# Import Management - Clean & Valid Imports Only

## 🎯 CRITICAL: IMPORT VALIDATION & CLEANUP

Every generated file must have **ONLY valid, used imports** with **NO unused imports**.

## 🚫 FORBIDDEN IMPORT PRACTICES

❌ **NEVER** import components that don't exist
❌ **NEVER** leave unused imports in files
❌ **NEVER** import entire libraries when only specific exports are needed
❌ **NEVER** use relative imports for UI components (use `@/components/ui/`)
❌ **NEVER** import the same module multiple times

## ✅ MANDATORY IMPORT STANDARDS

### **1. Import Validation (CRITICAL)**
```tsx
// ✅ BEFORE adding any import, verify the component exists:
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";        // ✅ Exists in shadcn
import { DataGrid } from "@/components/ui/data-grid";   // ✅ Exists after ReUI install
import { Card } from "@/components/ui/card";            // ✅ Exists in shadcn

// ❌ NEVER import without checking:
import { NonExistentComponent } from "@/components/ui/fake";  // ❌ Will cause errors
```

### **2. Required Shadcn Components Check**
Before generating any component that uses these imports, **ALWAYS** ensure they're installed:

```tsx
// ReUI Data Grid Dependencies (install if missing):
// npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator

// Common Dashboard Dependencies:
// npx shadcn@latest add button card input label badge dialog dropdown-menu

// Form Dependencies:
// npx shadcn@latest add input label button card textarea select

// Chart Dependencies (already installed):
// Recharts, Framer Motion, Lucide React
```

### **3. Import Organization (REQUIRED)**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Organized import order:

// 1. React and Next.js imports
import React, { useState, useMemo } from "react";
import { useRouter } from "next/navigation";

// 2. Third-party libraries
import { createColumnHelper, useReactTable } from "@tanstack/react-table";
import { motion } from "framer-motion";

// 3. UI components (alphabetical)
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader } from "@/components/ui/card";
import { DataGrid } from "@/components/ui/data-grid";

// 4. Custom components
import { UserAvatar } from "@/components/UserAvatar";

// 5. Icons (grouped)
import { EditIcon, TrashIcon, UserIcon } from "lucide-react";

// 6. Utils and types
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
import type { User } from "@/types/user";
```

### **4. Component Existence Verification**
```tsx
// ✅ STANDARD CHECK - Before any import:

// For shadcn components:
// 1. Check if file exists: src/components/ui/[component].tsx
// 2. If missing, install: npx shadcn@latest add [component]
// 3. Only then import and use

// For custom components:
// 1. Verify the component exists in the project
// 2. Check the exact export name
// 3. Use correct import path
```

## 🧹 UNUSED IMPORT REMOVAL (MANDATORY)

### **Auto-Cleanup Process**
```tsx
// ❌ BEFORE - Unused imports:
import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo } from "react";  // useEffect unused
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";              // Button unused
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader } from "@/components/ui/card";  // CardContent unused
import { motion } from "framer-motion";                       // motion unused
import { EditIcon, TrashIcon, UserIcon } from "lucide-react"; // TrashIcon unused

export default function MyComponent() {
  const [data, setData] = useState([]);
  
  return (
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <UserIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
        <EditIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
      </CardHeader>
    </Card>
  );
}

// ✅ AFTER - Only used imports:
import React, { useState } from "react";
import { Card, CardHeader } from "@/components/ui/card";
import { EditIcon, UserIcon } from "lucide-react";

export default function MyComponent() {
  const [data, setData] = useState([]);
  
  return (
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <UserIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
        <EditIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
      </CardHeader>
    </Card>
  );
}
```

## 🔧 IMPORT OPTIMIZATION RULES

### **1. Destructured Imports (PREFERRED)**
```tsx
// ✅ GOOD - Destructured imports:
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from "@/components/ui/card";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";

// ❌ AVOID - Namespace imports for UI components:
import * as Card from "@/components/ui/card";
import ButtonComponent from "@/components/ui/button";
```

### **2. Conditional Imports (ADVANCED)**
```tsx
// ✅ GOOD - Only import what's actually used:
import { DataGrid } from "@/components/ui/data-grid";
// Only include DataGridColumnFilter if filtering is actually implemented
import { DataGridColumnFilter } from "@/components/ui/data-grid-column-filter";
```

### **3. Type-Only Imports (TYPESCRIPT)**
```tsx
// ✅ GOOD - Separate type imports:
import type { User } from "@/types/user";
import type { Column } from "@tanstack/react-table";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
```

## 📋 VALIDATION CHECKLIST

Before completing any file generation:

### **Import Validation:**
- [ ] **All imports point to existing files?**
- [ ] **All imported components are actually used in the component?**
- [ ] **No duplicate imports from the same module?**
- [ ] **Import paths use correct aliases (@/ for src/)?**

### **Component Dependencies:**
- [ ] **Required shadcn components are installed?**
- [ ] **ReUI Data Grid dependencies available if used?**
- [ ] **Third-party packages exist in package.json?**
- [ ] **Custom components exist in the project?**

### **Code Quality:**
- [ ] **Imports are organized by category?**
- [ ] **Destructured imports used where appropriate?**
- [ ] **Type imports separated with 'type' keyword?**
- [ ] **No unused variables or imports remain?**

## 🚨 COMMON IMPORT ERRORS TO AVOID

### **1. Missing Component Installation**
```tsx
// ❌ ERROR - Component not installed:
import { Command } from "@/components/ui/command";  // Error if not installed

// ✅ SOLUTION - Install first:
// npx shadcn@latest add command
import { Command } from "@/components/ui/command";
```

### **2. Wrong Import Paths**
```tsx
// ❌ ERROR - Incorrect paths:
import { Button } from "components/ui/button";          // Missing @/
import { Button } from "@/components/button";           // Wrong path
import { Button } from "../../../components/ui/button"; // Relative path

// ✅ CORRECT - Proper aliases:
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
```

### **3. Importing Unused Components**
```tsx
// ❌ ERROR - Importing but never using:
import { Dialog, DialogContent, DialogHeader } from "@/components/ui/dialog";

export default function MyComponent() {
  return <div>No dialog used here</div>;
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Only import what you use:
export default function MyComponent() {
  return <div>No dialog used here</div>;
}
```

